flowchart TD
    U[Human priorities and current demo] --> L[Lead assigns bounded feature and isolated worktree]
    L --> O[Onboard: current design, lessons, source and map]
    O --> C[Freeze outcome and acceptance; save prospective diagram]
    C --> I[Implement against authoritative owners]
    I --> T[Developer runs focused headless checks and map checks]
    T -->|Actual defect| I
    T -->|Invalid verifier| R[Retain evidence; review new contract]
    R --> C
    T -->|Passed declared checks| P[Push exact commit and draft PR]
    P --> A[Lead technical review]
    P --> D[Game Designer design review, including lead PR]
    A -->|Changes requested| I
    D -->|Changes requested| C
    A --> G[Both exact-commit approvals required]
    D --> G
    G --> V[Lead integrates and verifies combined behavior]
    V --> H[Testable player handoff]
    H --> L
